{"title": "Nepal Mourns Over 1,300 Killed in Devastating Floods", "summary": "Nepal observed a national day of mourning, concluding a 13-day Hindu mourning period, following devastating floods that killed over 1,300 people. Search operations continued as priests, monks, and residents held prayer ceremonies on the banks of the Trishuli River for the deceased. Families also prayed for those still missing after the disaster.", "summary_points": ["Nepal observed a national day of mourning.", "The mourning period concluded 13 days of Hindu mourning.", "Over 1,300 people were killed in the floods.", "Search operations were ongoing.", "Prayer ceremonies were held for the deceased and missing."], "title_hi": "नेपाल में विनाशकारी बाढ़ के बाद 1,300 से अधिक लोगों की मौत पर शोक", "summary_hi": "नेपाल ने विनाशकारी बाढ़ के बाद राष्ट्रीय शोक दिवस मनाया, जिसने 1,300 से अधिक लोगों की जान ले ली। त्रिशूली नदी के किनारे पुरोहितों, भिक्षुओं और निवासियों ने मृतकों के लिए प्रार्थना सभाएं आयोजित कीं, जबकि खोज अभियान जारी रहे। परिवारों ने आपदा के बाद लापता हुए लोगों के लिए भी प्रार्थना की।", "summary_points_hi": ["नेपाल ने राष्ट्रीय शोक दिवस मनाया।", "शोक की अवधि 13 दिनों की हिंदू शोक अवधि के साथ समाप्त हुई।", "बाढ़ में 1,300 से अधिक लोग मारे गए थे।", "खोज अभियान जारी थे।", "मृतकों और लापता लोगों के लिए प्रार्थना सभाएं आयोजित की गईं।"], "framing": {"left": ["Highlights Singapore police investigation into 'racist' and 'anti-Indian' online comments linked to Air India."], "center": ["Coverage focused on the national day of mourning and prayer ceremonies for the deceased and missing.", "Emphasized the scale of the disaster, noting over 1,300 fatalities.", "Mentioned ongoing search operations."], "right": ["Leads with the occurrence of two earthquakes in Nepal and Tibet shortly before the flood death toll surged past 1,300."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["एयर इंडिया से जुड़े 'नस्लवादी' और 'भारत-विरोधी' ऑनलाइन टिप्पणियों में सिंगापुर पुलिस की जांच पर प्रकाश डालता है।"], "center": ["कवरेज में राष्ट्रीय शोक दिवस और मृतकों तथा लापता लोगों के लिए प्रार्थना सभाओं पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया।", "आपदा के पैमाने पर जोर दिया गया, जिसमें 1,300 से अधिक मौतें दर्ज की गईं।", "जारी खोज अभियानों का उल्लेख किया गया।"], "right": ["बाढ़ से मरने वालों की संख्या 1,300 से अधिक होने से ठीक पहले नेपाल और तिब्बत में दो भूकंप आने की खबर को प्रमुखता देता है।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/f_mo_lon_nepal_mourning_260908/1/abs/index.m3u8", "sources": [{"source": "Times Now", "owner": "Times Now", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Two Earthquakes Rock Nepal and Tibet in Hours as Flood Death Toll Surges Past 1,300"}, {"source": "NBC News", "owner": "NBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/video/nepal-observes-day-of-mourning-after-devastating-floods-269464645719", "headline": "Nepal observes day of mourning after devastating floods"}, {"source": "Global News (Canada)", "owner": "Global News (Canada)", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBLbmw4VWpyRkRldi03UzgybXpsMW04NlJIa2s1dWh3ZXQyMGR1THRfb2YzOUEwZVhlYnFmSkxmR1hsZWlxRHEwLTZ0SHEwZkI0aHlndWxKT21WWnlmblFmcE1rUG13R29NSnhJb2ZFNmJrdTA?oc=5", "headline": "Nepal holds day of mourning after deadly floods kill at least 1,300"}, {"source": "South China Morning Post", "owner": "South China Morning Post", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQc183c3hST0NHeUo0UmttbW5TYmNCOWJsZWg0d2ZlN1M4X21OcDFiMW8zeVVzYmxIUE45OHpJdVFWLUJESjRQeXhFdEVJVi1uOWtEYVlSTEEyeWI3R2U5YThCVWxMRUU4U1ZENFBaUkppYVBEWENYNWtxeEJyM3RPMmV5V3lBd3dqTFlHaWdvLWlLNzJmenMzb3Z2R2Vwa2hfSEE?oc=5", "headline": "Reunited families pray for Nepal’s missing on national day of mourning"}, {"source": "The Japan Times", "owner": "The Japan Times", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "